-- title:
--   Original infinite-activity BV cash dominated by a centred original-filtration stochastic increment
-- statement:
--   Produce for each strict inner dividend horizon and full surviving postpayment T reward an integrable compensating increment M on the original probability space, with zero conditional expectation against the original right-continuous initial filtration and with the exact cash payoff bounded almost surely by w(x)+M. The physical construction must use original predictable jump compensation, integrable infinite small-negative-mark truncation, arbitrary singular dividend clocks including zero-time rights, common jumps, zero reserve, ruin and T endpoints; no finite activity, alternate source X/P, or unsupported global generator L1.
